# Every text file checks out with LF, on every platform. The hooks are bash
# scripts, and Git for Windows' default of converting to CRLF on checkout
# breaks them at their first command. run-hook.cmd is a batch/bash polyglot;
# its batch half never jumps to a label (no goto, no call), so cmd.exe reads it
# correctly with LF too.
* text=auto eol=lf
